$\begin{aligned}f'(x)&=2\cdot2x\\&=4x\\g'(x)&=4x\end{aligned}$
The $+9$ shifts the parabola vertically without changing the tangent gradient at any $x$.
(b) Both derivative graphs are the straight line $y=4x$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=7mm,y=1.75mm]
